  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "モンスターボールよりもポケモンを捕まえやすくなったが重くなり飛距離は短くなった。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "몬스터볼보다도 더욱 포켓몬을 잡기 쉬워진 약간 성능이 좋고 신비한 볼.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不可思議的球。性能還算不錯，比起精靈球更容易捉到寶可夢。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cette étrange balle aux capacités étonnantes permet d’attraper les Pokémon plus facilement qu’avec une Poké Ball.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mit diesem rätselhaften Ball sind Pokémon noch leichter zu fangen als mit einem Pokéball.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Misteriosa bola de alto rendimiento. Tiene un índice de éxito superior al de la Poké Ball.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Poké Ball misteriosa dalle ottime prestazioni: fornisce maggiori probabilità di cattura rispetto alla normale Poké Ball.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mysterious ball that provides a higher success rate for catching Pokémon than a standard Poké Ball.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "モンスターボールよりもさらにポケモンを捕まえやすくなった少し性能のいい不思議なボール。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
